# Converted from corpus/flowcharts/0074.mmd by corpus/convert.py.
OpenClaw Agent -> "@epsilla/clawtrace plugin"
"@epsilla/clawtrace plugin" -> Ingest Service: POST /v1/traces/events
Ingest Service -> Raw JSON Events
Raw JSON Events -> Databricks Lakeflow
Databricks Lakeflow -> Iceberg Silver Tables
Iceberg Silver Tables -> PuppyGraph
PuppyGraph -> Backend API: Cypher
PuppyGraph -> Tracy MCP Server: Cypher
Backend API -> Neon PostgreSQL
Payment Service -> Neon PostgreSQL
Payment Service -> Stripe
Tracy MCP Server -> Tracy Agent: tool results
Tracy Agent -> Backend API: SSE stream
ClawTrace UI -> Backend API: REST API
ClawTrace UI -> Backend API: SSE
Backend API -> Payment Service: deficit check

Agent Runtime { OpenClaw Agent, "@epsilla/clawtrace plugin" }
Ingest Layer { Ingest Service }
Data Lake { Raw JSON Events, Databricks Lakeflow, Iceberg Silver Tables }
Graph Layer { PuppyGraph }
Backend Services { Backend API, Payment Service, Tracy MCP Server }
AI Layer { Tracy Agent }
Frontend { ClawTrace UI, Documentation }
External { Neon PostgreSQL, Stripe }
